the map whenever they are in trouble ] and this without mentioning the horrendous match engine at the start - whole minutes go by to get to get matched and play, only to get stuck with a cheating troll.  If you, developer,  just don't care about your game anymore, just sell it, or have the decency to take it down. Just a waste of a good concept.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id461439418"}, "name": {"label": "lex*8"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-08-18T00:47:41-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "2"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.6.2"}, "id": {"label": "10271423420"}, "title": {"label": "ban?"}, "content": {"label": "this game is so good. i love it, but there have been so many times me and my bf have played and the screen glitches for one of us so we both end up leaving the match. my bf got a pop up saying if it continues he\u2019ll be banned??", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id320951652"}, "name": {"label": "Biscuit chef"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-07-27T19:53:17-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.6.2"}, "id": {"label": "10189985051"}, "title": {"label": "The company doesn\u2019t care anymore"}, "content": {"label": "This USED TO BE A GOOD, ENGAGING GAME. Not anymore. Don\u2019t bother. You can\u2019t even build your skill anymore. All you do is wait for a player to show up that almost never does.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id978417140"}, "name": {"label": "RushingViper07"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-07-19T16:10:11-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.6.2"}, "id": {"label": "10159283896"}, "title": {"label": "This game is awesome"}, "content": {"label": "I grew up playing this game years ago, and re installed it recently. This game is satisfying, smooth, and a great game to play with friends. I hope this game stays on the App Store forever, because it\u2019s just that good.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id983916770"}, "name": {"label": "Mr Mannino"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-06-21T09:15:15-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "4"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.6.2"}, "id": {"label": "10057508162"}, "title": {"label": "Awesome game!\u2026 but controls are strange"}, "content": {"label": "For Mobile players like me the whole turn your phone/iPad is weird\nbecause if I start at, say a sideways angle when I turn the iPad up right the plane glitches, and more like the plane at a perfect strait angle it turns left or right. that\u2019s why I want a joystick.\nBut the game is great! I\u2019ve flown paper planes and toy planes for years and this game is perfect! I\u2019ve always wanted to do toy plane battles for a real long time and now I have it.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id197436010"}, "name": {"label": "Hammer, 257"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-06-19T14:31:43-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.6.2"}, "id": {"label": "10051382519"}, "title": {"label": "Problem guiding maneuvering the plane. All it does is go straight."}, "content": {"label": "I\u2019m having a problem flying the planes all they do is keep going straight so I have to quit every time. What is the problem? Can you please tell me I got a message from your company saying they\u2019re going to take me off the game because I keep quitting I have no choice but to quit because I can\u2019t maneuver the plane.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1419880780"}, "name": {"label": "Bruno squid"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2023-06-05T18:49:25-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "3"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.6.2"}, "id": {"label": "10003659756"}, "title": {"label": "When you press pause"}, "content": {"label": "There\u2019s a bug where you press the pause button and you try to press \u201cresume game\u201d and \u201csettings\u201d and \u201cend game\u201d nothing happens please fix this bug!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "rela