 "im:version": {"label": "14.6.1"}, "id": {"label": "8851980606"}, "title": {"label": "Air wings is great fun"}, "content": {"label": "I have been playing this game for many years. I recently moved out of state and play with my friends and kids almost every day.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1381445440"}, "name": {"label": "CoolAqua292"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-07-04T14:34:35-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.6.1"}, "id": {"label": "8840897944"}, "title": {"label": "Poor Game!!"}, "content": {"label": "I just played this game and I could not control the plane and every time I pressed the pause button the Game Froze!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id118962091"}, "name": {"label": "MRondot"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-06-28T13:21:51-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.6"}, "id": {"label": "8820166165"}, "title": {"label": "I\u2019ve searched for 4 years"}, "content": {"label": "This was my favorite game as a kid I lost it and couldn\u2019t find it but I found it after 4 years of nonstop searching", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1177570074"}, "name": {"label": "HahaMarioMario"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-06-11T06:00:04-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.5"}, "id": {"label": "8763294719"}, "title": {"label": "I love this game!"}, "content": {"label": "If you're questioning whether or not to download this game, download it! I usually don't play in online matches, but practice modes are fun for me! I've been playing this game for years, and I love it, 100% recommend!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id35569615"}, "name": {"label": "The-Davester"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-05-31T13:11:32-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.5"}, "id": {"label": "8727666536"}, "title": {"label": "I\u2019m THE-ONE. The one to beat..."}, "content": {"label": "Love it. Everyone is afraid of playing me...", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28238198"}, "name": {"label": "Preppy H"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-05-23T22:35:32-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.5"}, "id": {"label": "8702283540"}, "title": {"label": "This Game is Dog Sh*t"}, "content": {"label": "How anyone reviews this more than 1 star (it should be zero) is amazing.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id230276665"}, "name": {"label": "Fw52"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-05-20T10:09:05-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "4"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.5"}, "id": {"label": "8690518249"}, "title": {"label": "Spawn killing jerks"}, "content": {"label": "The game is great except for the spawn killers. I\u2019ve played this game from the beginning. I held a very high position for a long time. I NEVER spawn killed, and always helped teach the newbies how to play by allowing them to chase and even shoot me down. Why you haven\u2019t addressed spawn killers is beyond me. It ruins the game because it takes a long time to get matched. Couldn\u2019t the developers allow a longer period of time after spawning to gather ammo before you can be hit?", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id104577340"}, "name": {"label": "PeacefulJay"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-05-08T20:24:31-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "2"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.5"}, "id": {"label": "8652065238"}, "title": {"label": "Too many jerks playing this game"}, "content": {"label": "This game has been taken over by people who evidently live in their parents\u2019 basements and have spent thousands of hours eating Hot Pockets and figuring out every possible trick to exploit gross, serious weaknesses in the game software to avoid getting hit by even a gargantuan flurry of 50-80 rubberbands.\n\nSee, the auto-aiming\u2014which you\u2019re FORCED to use (no manual option exists)\u2014is laughably bad. These morons have figured out how to flick their planes rapidly to almost completely foil any attempt to hit them with any weapon.\n\nDon\u2019t believe me? Try flying a Quad\u2014which the developer lies and says is just as accurate as any other plane. You can be flying straight at a Dart, he\u2019s not even dodging, you can fire 40 rubber bands, darts, anything, and they will ALL MIRACULOUSLY MISS. It\u2019s such a load of crap!\n\nThen, of course, even though your Quad has far heavier armor than the Dart, and is much more massive, the two planes collide head-on and your Quad is THROWN VIOLENTLY into the nearest obstacle or wall, and you die. The rinky-dink Dart is UNTOUCHED. This also happens to the Quad when it passes by a floating mine.\n\nYou can COAT any other plane with darts, and it will survive them. But a Dart or other plane has but to hit a Quad with maybe five or six darts and the Quad will be devastated if not shot down from full health.\n\nThis game needs an option to turn off auto aiming and just let the player aim straight ahead. The way it works now, you cannot even \u201clead\u201d another plane, because the truly stupid AI aiming thinks it knows better than you do, and sends off all your ammo to ridiculous corners of the field. And god forbid you as a Quad fire a salvo of missiles! They automatically slam directly downward or to the side, instead of AT your target!\n\nThe game needs a lot of work.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1019984821"}, "name": {"label": "successor \ud83e\udd85"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-04-22T18:33:42-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.5"}, "id": {"label": "8596089034"}, "title": {"label": "This first time writing a review"}, "content": {"label": "WORST GAME IN HISTORY\u2026.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1361859565"}, "name": {"label": "Broke from Mech Arean"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-03-22T11:14:49-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.5"}, "id": {"label": "8484084472"}, "title": {"label": "Lousy Directions"}, "content": {"label": "Set traps? How? What weapons to pick up? What weapons are better? How, how, how? I don\u2019t have all day\u2026I work. The last thing I want, is to figure out how your game works\u2026", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1029809267"}, "name": {"label": "justafrustratedparent"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-03-21T08:43:06-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.5"}, "id": {"label": "8480303638"}, "title": {"label": "Inappropriate profile pictures"}, "content": {"label": "Very disappointed. Deleted immediately after finding some of the profile pictures of the other players contained nudity. If nudity in profiles is going to be allowed, the game needs to have an appropriate rating.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1186014772"}, "name": {"label": "lolsus:)"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2022-01-28T19:35:19-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "14.5"}, "id": {"label": "8294357600"}, "title": {"label": "i play this game once i was like 5-4 years old i never saw it tell 13"}, "content": {"label": ":)", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=496386846&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}], "updated": {"label": "2026-10-25T04:17:34-07:00"}, "rights": {"label": "Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title": {"label": "iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon": {"label": "http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link": [{"attributes": {"rel": "alternate", "type": "text/html", "href": "https://music.apple.com/WebObjects/MZStore.woa/wa/viewGrouping?cc=us&id=1"}}, {"attributes": {"rel": "self", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/rss/customerreviews/page=1/id=496386846/sortby=mostrecent/json"}}, {"attributes": {"rel": "first", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/rss/customerreviews/page=1/id=496386846/sortby=mostrecent/xml?urlDesc=/customerreviews/page=1/id=496386846/sortby=mostrecent/json"}}, {"attributes": {"rel": "last", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/rss/customerreviews/page=10/id=496386846/sortby=mostrecent/xml?urlDesc=/c